# Empty states / no data

Mandatory. Present and future.

When a section has no data, is pending, or does not apply, **do not** show only a paragraph in an empty gap.

## Required pattern

Use the shared empty state from `glassmorphism.scss`:

```html
<div class="empty-state">
  <div class="empty-state-icon">
    <ion-icon name="clipboard-outline" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>
  </div>
  <p class="empty-state-title">Short title</p>
  <p class="empty-state-hint">One line that explains what is missing or what will happen.</p>
</div>
```

Visual reference: `trip-empty-state` (same look: circular icon, title, hint).

## Rules

- Title in sentence case, short.
- Brief hint; no long paragraphs.
- Existing project icon (`ionicons`), matching the context.
- Do not invent a different empty state per screen (other colors, odd cards, spinners as a substitute).
- If the block already has a section header, the empty state goes in the body; do not repeat the same title twice unless needed.

## Incorrect

```html
<p class="algo-hint">Esta novedad no tiene plantilla de campos configurada.</p>
```

## Correct

```html
<div class="empty-state">
  <div class="empty-state-icon">
    <ion-icon name="clipboard-outline" aria-hidden="true"></ion-icon>
  </div>
  <p class="empty-state-title">Sin plantilla de gestión</p>
  <p class="empty-state-hint">Esta novedad no tiene plantilla de campos configurada.</p>
</div>
```
